  "details": "1. Open up VRChat\n\n2. Go into avatar favorites, select an avatar. This will be a list of avatars you've favorited. \"View Avatar Details\" The button is labeled \"Favorite\" but when you click on this, it asks to confirm Unfavoriting.\n\nGot this on both Oculus (Rift CV1) and Steam (Desktop)",
